WEBVTT

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:26.840
Intruders!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:30.780
Sir!

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.010
This way.

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:47.820
Damn it!

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:41.490
<i>Asura Cryin' 2</i>

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.460
"The Sad Connection between Love and Magic"

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:29.280
Intruders?

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:34.010
Recently, there's been a family of demons that has been causing us some trouble.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:38.560
Your father wanted me to tell you to be careful.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:42.000
I'll be going now.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.140
Be careful.

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.290
Yes.

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.370
Listen up!

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:57.830
"Sports Festival Event"

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:57.830
"Three-legged Race Female Participants"

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:57.830
"Reiko Saeki, Takatsuki Kanade"

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:57.630
These two are our participants for the Sports Festival's three-legged race.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.800
Boys, raise your hand if you'd like to volunteer to pair up with either one.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.260
This doesn't look good, Tomo.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.700
We've got a lot of competition.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:09.520
Huh?

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.340
Damn it. I've got to do something.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:12.930
I know!

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:17.130
Hey, Tomo. Have you heard about the curse of Rakurowa High School?

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:18.160
What curse?

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:23.150
Yeah. Couples that form from three-legged race pairs...

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:25.330
...are cursed with unhappiness.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.060
What are you talking about?

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.200
Sounds like a bunch of bull.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:32.640
Well, I can't make you believe it.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:36.900
To tell you the truth, the reason Hashiratani-sensei is still single...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.020
...and hasn't been around lately...

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:42.540
...is all because of the curse of the three-legged race.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:43.890
Is he serious?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.510
Curse of the three-legged race?

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:46.560
Sounds awful.

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:47.620
I don't want to be cursed.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:50.910
What's going on?

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:52.560
Aren't there any volunteers?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.020
Our boys are just a bunch of wimps.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:01.750
Hey, Saeki.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.010
Tomo and I will participate.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:04.690
Huh?

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.250
The three-legged race.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.540
We don't need reluctant participants!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:10.680
We'll do it!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.060
Let us do it! Please!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.650
What's wrong with him?

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.730
And after spreading that rumor, too.

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.730
How insolent.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.640
He'll get his comeuppance.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.570
Are you doing okay, Nia?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.430
What do you mean?

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.750
Oh, uh...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.270
You've been through a lot lately...

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.650
If you're asking about my sister, it's fine.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.650
There's so much to figure out...

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.650
...I don't have time to be sad.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.790
I see.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.940
Let us know if there's anything we can do.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:42.550
Sure.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:47.900
Alright! Let's do this!

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:50.720
I wonder when Reiko-chan will get here.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:51.810
Seriously, Higuchi.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.360
Aren't you being a hypocrite?

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:56.210
It can't be helped, right?

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.330
Someone's got to do it.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:01.790
I've resigned myself to being cursed.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:04.730
Tomo, you pair up with Takatsuki.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:05.440
Huh?

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:08.700
I'll be leading Reiko-chan.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.010
Tomo, what are you blushing about?

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.240
You should be grateful to me.

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:21.060
Shut up, you two!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.180
What's this?

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:24.850
So you two are a pair.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:27.000
Looks like it.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:29.320
An-chan, you're in the relay race, right?

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.260
Yeah.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:34.170
As a member of the track team, I've got to participate in the Sports Festival.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.100
By the way, Takatsuki-san...

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.660
...make sure you tie that ribbon tightly.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.660
If it comes undone, you'll be disqualified.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:42.660
Yes.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:46.680
Okay then.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.000
On your marks...

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:49.470
...get set...

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.260
W-wait!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.050
Huh?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.290
Is something wrong?

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:56.780
Um, Natsume-kun, put your hand on my hip.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:57.840
Huh?

00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.040
Oh, right!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.190
Come on, Tomo. Quickly.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.480
Put your hand around her hips.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:05.210
S-sure.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.360
More!

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.210
Hold her tighter!

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.000
O-okay.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.790
You pervert!

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:13.970
H-hey!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.500
From the top.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.640
Ready...

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.640
...start!

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:21.370
One, two!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:22.340
One, two!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.280
One, two!

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:24.310
One, two!

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:24.310
Naughty!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.190
One, two!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.190
Naughty!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.040
One, two!

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.040
Naughty!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.510
Come on!

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:30.890
Don't you think you're a little too close to her, Tomo?

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:32.500
Right, Takatsuki-san?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.820
I can't help it. It's a three-legged race.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:44.220
You must feel like you're in heaven, Tomoharu-kun.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.100
Ow...

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:48.510
Takatsuki, my leg! My leg!

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:51.160
Uh, oh.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.270
You better get that off before you lose circulation.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:58.380
Hurry!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:07:00.380
But the knot...

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:01.030
What?

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:04.700
Wow, we're going to need some scissors.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.900
How tight did you tie that, anyway?

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.690
Why don't you go back to the classroom so you can cut it?

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:12.690
I'll stay here and wait for Reiko-chan.

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:14.510
One, two.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:15.890
One, two.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:17.100
One, two.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:19.770
Tomo, I'm sure you've noticed...

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:21.620
...but everyone's staring at you.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.560
If you think I noticed, don't tell me.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.910
I'm sorry. This is my fault.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.370
Don't worry. It's not your fault.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:33.900
Exactly! This is all because of Tomo's wicked heart.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:34.690
Oh, come on.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.860
Where are you, Reiko-chan?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:42.830
Sorry to have kept you waiting, Higuchi-kun.

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:43.770
What?

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:47.380
My sister developed a sudden headache and won't be coming...

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.230
...so I'll be filling in for her today.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:52.290
What?

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.960
Let's get started.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.870
Ready, sir!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.220
Good work.

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.390
Look, brother...

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:03.600
What?

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.330
You have no reason to call me "brother!"

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.470
Or what?

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:11.500
Do you have that kind of relationship with Reiko?

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.550
No, no. That's not...

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:17.610
Then watch what you say.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:18.930
Y-yes.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:20.750
You've got to be kidding.

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:22.190
One, two.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:23.510
One, two.

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:26.100
You're almost there.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:27.510
You can do it!

00:08:28.510 --> 00:08:29.390
One, two.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:30.270
One...

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:38.850
It's sticky?

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.780
It's rock solid.

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.220
You can't even cut it with a saw.

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:47.040
What?

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.190
There is a special solvent...

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.770
...but I ran out.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:54.300
I'm supposed to get some by tomorrow.

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.440
So then...

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:58.470
Are they stuck like this until that gets here?

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.560
You can't be serious.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.500
I'm sorry.

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:03.290
It's not your fault, Takatsuki.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.610
Looks like it came true, though.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.570
Higuchi's three-legged race curse.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.820
What are you doing to our captain?

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:23.790
Show some respect!

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.370
Put some energy into it!

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:29.280
Y-yes.

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:31.130
One, two.

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:32.720
One, two.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.660
You two are looking pretty weak.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.570
Why don't you rest in the nurse's office?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.830
I guess we could do that.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:41.830
Yes.

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:45.530
We're coming in!

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.080
Looks like the nurse isn't here.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.840
Let's find somewhere to sit.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.690
Uh, um...

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:57.690
I was hoping to wipe off the sweat.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.360
I know, right?

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.450
Why don't you go behind this curtain?

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:03.240
Okay.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.350
W-what's going on?

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.610
Natsume!

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.050
W-wait! This is just a misunderstanding!

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.400
I need to tell my brother!

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.100
Reishiro!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:24.450
What's wrong, Reiko?

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:25.620
There he is!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:26.830
Higuchi!

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:30.350
He's fine. He just overexerted himself during practice.

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:32.000
What's going on?

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.880
These two were up to no good!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:35.990
What?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.990
Tomoharu Natsume.

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:42.900
Have all my warnings been falling on deaf ears?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:44.950
Look, you've got it all wrong.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.950
You're filthy! Terrible!

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.570
No, listen...

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.650
I-it's not Natsume-kun's fault.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.300
It was my idea.

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.300
What?

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:59.080
Takatsuki-san, you're feeding the flames.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.730
Damn it!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.200
Let's run, Takatsuki!

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.550
Stop!

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:05.630
Stop running!

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:08.340
The koala is angry!

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.100
Feel its terrible wrath!

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:12.420
Nia!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.590
What have you been up to?

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.710
We'll explain later! Help us!

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:20.880
The koala's eyes!

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.850
No one can stop it now!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:24.840
Huh?

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.660
R-run!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:42.350
I guess they don't get the reference.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.490
Looks like we chipped the ceramic knife.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.960
We should be okay here.

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:56.300
Are you sure you aren't just running so you can stay with Takatsuki-san?

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:57.600
Seriously.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.420
What's wrong, Takatsuki?

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.180
They're all over each other.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:04.650
Kids these days.

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.000
This isn't...

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.850
Hey, perverts!

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.760
Perverts, perverts!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.130
Are you alright?

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:18.250
What about you? You must be exhausted.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.600
I'm fine. But the sweat...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.830
Uh, thanks.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.730
Tomo, you're not a kid.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:32.000
Why don't you go take a shower?

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:32.910
Huh?

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:37.930
I'll be fine if I just skip one day.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:42.780
But I'd like to shower if possible.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:43.720
What?

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:46.920
I'm undressing.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.940
Wow, Takatsuki-san!

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.180
They're enormous!

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.080
They look so soft!

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.410
And they're so pale!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:58.580
They look just like mochi.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.310
I don't do that.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:05.280
You start washing there?

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:06.800
It's the curse.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.770
It's the curse of the three-legged race.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.330
Higuchi-kun.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.230
That was a refreshing workout.

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:17.230
Yes.

00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:20.700
The time we spent practicing was time well spent.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.810
It certainly was.

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.630
What's wrong, Higuchi-kun?

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:27.480
It's the curse.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:30.920
It's the curse of the three-legged race.

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:38.590
I thought I was finally going to sleep with Kanade again...

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.790
You're right, Nia-chan.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.140
Don't you wish you could have Takatsuki-san to yourself while you sleep?

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:46.550
It can't be helped.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.080
You're getting in my way!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.960
If I knew this would happen, I would have eaten your luck!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.720
Give me a break.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:56.980
I'll keep watch so Tomo doesn't try anything weird.

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:58.680
I wouldn't do anything!

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.970
I saw that nosebleed in the bathroom.

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.210
You can't sleep?

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.500
Takatsuki, you're awake?

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.000
Does your leg hurt?

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.640
It's fine.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.610
Would you like to go out on the balcony?

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:33.110
Huh?

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:35.430
We shouldn't wake those two.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.510
Right.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.780
One, two.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.660
One, two.

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:49.240
We've put ourselves in a really inconvenient situation.

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.530
Good thing we have the day off tomorrow.

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.930
We can stay at home until the solvent arrives.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:15:00.280
Oh, there's a place I was hoping to visit tomorrow.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.010
Huh?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:03.780
I was going to visit a grave.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.300
Tomorrow is the anniversary of my mother's death.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.530
I didn't know your mother passed away.

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:12.760
A long time ago.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:14.350
I see.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:18.850
Now that you mention it, I've never heard you talk about your mother.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.430
I have to visit her.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:25.900
My father doesn't really remember her any more.

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:26.810
What?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:32.360
Demon's magic isn't free.

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:35.620
Female demons consume their partner's love...

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:40.290
...and the more male demons use their magic...

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:43.260
...the more they forget about their partner.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.080
You can't be serious.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:47.780
Then as long as your father keeps using magic...

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.390
He will continue to lose his memories of my mother.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.880
So that's why you're...

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.440
It hurts to see my father...

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.670
...lose his memories of my mother.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.240
I'm sorry you had to tag along.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:24.760
It's fine.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.050
Besides, no one wants to spend their day off at home.

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:32.610
And the solvent should arrive by the time we go home.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.690
We'll be in trouble if it doesn't.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:36.250
There you go again!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:38.920
I know you're actually pretty happy with this situation.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:40.010
Oh, come on.

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:44.970
The Takatsuki group.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:58.130
Sir, your daughter.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:16:59.130
What?

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:12.260
Shouldn't you go say hi to your dad?

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:14.260
No.

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:16.670
I don't have anything to say to him.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:22.690
I wonder what it's like to forget the people you loved.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:25.570
It's probably sad.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.710
Watch out! There's fierce magic in the air!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.560
Stand back!

00:17:37.640 --> 00:17:38.930
But...

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:46.950
Father!

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:48.800
Protect the boss!

00:17:54.360 --> 00:17:55.180
They're demons!

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.880
Run, Kanade!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.290
Father!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.460
Come and get me!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:10.840
Old fool!

00:18:16.390 --> 00:18:17.530
Pathetic whelp!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.740
You'll need a hundred years' more experience to fight me!

00:18:23.670 --> 00:18:24.230
Yagi!

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:31.660
Father!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:37.240
D-don't worry about me. Just fight.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.270
Well said, Tomo!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.860
In that case, don't mind if I...

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:43.320
...fight!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:44.940
Huh?

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:49.640
Finish him!

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:55.750
Kanade!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.180
My mother loved my father.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:02.680
I will protect him!

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:04.210
You brat!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.000
Damn it!

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:33.880
Leave my family alone!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.080
Damn!

00:19:39.430 --> 00:19:40.110
Retreat!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.100
They did it!

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:13.650
"Takatsuki Family"

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.940
You're starting to look like your mother, Kanade.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.110
I was able to remember your mother...

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.720
...by watching you fight.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.100
Father.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.510
Your mother couldn't be stopped when she got angry.

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:38.270
It was terrifying.

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:39.000
Huh?

00:20:50.050 --> 00:20:52.490
Tomo's leg is free again...

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:54.160
...so I guess everything's resolved.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:21:00.680
Now that I think about it, there's no reason you couldn't have just burned the ribbon off right away.

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:01.390
Huh?

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:04.300
Were you just pretending not to know?

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:08.290
That's a secret.

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:09.940
What's going on?

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:11.430
Oh, nothing.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.220
It's her!

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:27.770
Tomo?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:36.280
She disappeared?

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:41.400
That's...

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:44.570
...Nao-kun's grave?

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:21.240
I want to find it.

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:22.270
I want to hide it.

00:23:22.270 --> 00:23:23.120
Just this.

00:23:23.240 --> 00:23:24.210
Anything and everything.

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:25.850
If you insist.

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:27.590
It's just another lie.

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:30.140
Scratching deep in the heart.

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:32.010
Out of it rises...

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:34.980
"The Truth Dedicated to You"
